      "expected": "A series current-limiting/protection resistor on a fan PWM input should be a meaningful value, typically hundreds of ohms to 1 kΩ in this circuit; the other signal series resistors are 1 kΩ (R2, R4). A 1 Ω resistor is effectively a short and does not provide the intended protection.",
